<title>LITHUANIA: Yields fall on three-month Lithuanian T-bills.</title>
<headline>Yields fall on three-month Lithuanian T-bills.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yields fell on three-month Lithuanian Treasury bills at Tuesday's auction and the issue was oversubscribed, the central bank said.</p>
<p>All amounts are in millions of litas.</p>
<p>MATURITY  AV YIELD  (LAST TIME)   MIN/MAX   ISSUE  BID  SOLD</p>
<p> 91-days    12.58	14.58	12.48/13.45  40  136.2  40</p>
<p>--Ed Stoddard, Riga newsroom +371 721 52 40</p>
</text>
